 "name_en": "Service – Workforce Procurement (7GE)",
 "description_en_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>Service – Workforce Procurement (7GE)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loio8695572f5b3c45b5825212a0bc57f2b6\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio8695572f5b3c45b5825212a0bc57f2b6__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Overview</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">In cases where external expertise is required, the companies own workforce capacity is limited, or certain service aspects are executed by contractors, procurement of (external) workforce is required and needs to be embedded into the service process.</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">This scope item enables the service manager to request external workforce via a dedicated external service item. This generates a purchase requisition followed-up by a purchase order for the requested workforce. To ensure the service execution is documented by the external employee, a service entry sheet is created and gathers all service activities. The information from the service entry sheet after approval ends up in the service confirmation, so it can be included into service billing and invoicing.</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio8695572f5b3c45b5825212a0bc57f2b6__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Key Process Flow</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\" id=\"loio8695572f5b3c45b5825212a0bc57f2b6__ul_ohc_f3s_pbc\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Create service order with external service item.</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Release of service order generates purchase requisition.</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Create purchase order based on purchase requisition.</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Create and edit service entry sheet.</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Approval of service entry sheet and posting of goods receipt.</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Service billing and invoicing.</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio8695572f5b3c45b5825212a0bc57f2b6__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Business Benefits</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\" id=\"loio8695572f5b3c45b5825212a0bc57f2b6__ul_qpc_h3s_pbc\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Embedded workforce procurement into service management process.</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Automated purchase integration considering procurement info records.</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Recording of service execution through service entry sheet.</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Automatic cost posting.</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Integrated into service billing and invoicing.</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
 "description_zh_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>服务 - 劳动力采购 (7GE)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loio8695572f5b3c45b5825212a0bc57f2b6\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio8695572f5b3c45b5825212a0bc57f2b6__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">概览</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">在需要外部专业知识的情况下，公司自有劳动力能力有限，或者某些服务方面由承包商执行，需要采购（外部）劳动力并需要将其嵌入服务流程中。</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">此范围项目使服务经理能够通过专用的外部服务项目请求外部劳动力。这将生成一个采购申请，后续是请求劳动力的采购订单。为确保外部员工记录服务执行，将创建服务条目表并收集所有服务活动。审批后，服务条目表中的信息将在服务确认中结束，因此可以包含在服务开票和开发票中。</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio8695572f5b3c45b5825212a0bc57f2b6__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">关键流程流</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\" id=\"loio8695572f5b3c45b5825212a0bc57f2b6__ul_ohc_f3s_pbc\">\n       <li class=\"li\">创建含外部服务项目的服务订单。</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">审批服务订单会生成采购申请。</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">基于采购申请创建采购订单。</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">创建和编辑服务条目表。</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">审批服务条目表和过账收货。</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">服务开票和开发票。</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio8695572f5b3c45b5825212a0bc57f2b6__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">业务优势</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\" id=\"loio8695572f5b3c45b5825212a0bc57f2b6__ul_qpc_h3s_pbc\">\n       <li class=\"li\">将劳动力采购嵌入到服务管理流程中。</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">考虑采购信息记录的自动采购集成。</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">通过服务条目表记录服务执行。</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">自动成本过账。</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">集成到服务开票和开发票中。</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
